  diseaseId: gerd
  diseaseName: "REFL\xDC"
  generalInfo: "Refl\xFC, mide i\xE7eri\u011Finin yemek borusuna geri ka\xE7mas\u0131yla
    olu\u015Fan bir sindirim sistemi hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda
    g\xF6\u011F\xFCs ortas\u0131nda yanma, bo\u011Faza do\u011Fru yay\u0131lan yanma
    ve a\u011F\u0131za ek\u015Fi/ac\u0131 s\u0131v\u0131 gelmesi g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Birka\xE7 g\xFCnd\xFCr s\xFCren yanma, g\xF6\u011F\xFCs ortas\u0131nda
    yanma, bo\u011Faza do\u011Fru yay\u0131lan yanma ve yemek sonras\u0131 artan
    yanma refl\xFCde s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131 hastalarda
    sabah ses k\u0131s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 olabilir."
